My concern is with those persons who were in the past interested in TLI 
Loglan, were never involved in the various political imbroglios, and 
now might be interested in LLG Loglan. I wish to facilitate their 
becoming aware of LLG Loglan, as I believe that will best allow them to 
pursue their interest in Loglan and will help to build the community of 
speakers.

-Steven


